      {"t":"type","p":"Jak se to jmenuje?","a":["What is it called","What's it called","What is this called","What's this called","What is that called","What's that called"],"hint":"what · it · called – česky „jak“, anglicky „what“","x":["How"],"why":"Na název se anglicky ptáš slovem „what“. „How is it called?“ je čechismus."}
